<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    O/N =  8.50%			 O/N = 7.65%</p>
<p>	    T/N =  7.65%			 T/N = 9.35%</p>
<p>		   Nov 15, 1996			Nov 14, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  8.50%	1 month forward =  6.80%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  8.67%	2 month forward =  7.31%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  8.84%	3 month forward =  7.59%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  8.84%	4 month forward =  7.99%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  8.97%	5 month forward =  8.23%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  8.77%	6 month forward =  8.05%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
